  "grammar": [
    {
      "id": "b3_u08_l1_g1",
      "pattern": "A-아/어지다",
      "meaning_uz": "...lashmoq, ...bo'lib qolmoq (holat o'zgarishi)",
      "meaning_en": "To become … (change of state)",
      "explanation_md": "**-아/어지다** sifatga qo'shilib, holatning **o'zgarishini** bildiradi: \"**...bo'lib qolmoq**\", \"**...lashmoq**\".\n\n**날씨가 점점 추워져요.** — *Havo borgan sari sovuqlashyapti.*\n\n### Qanday yasaladi\n\n-아요/어요 qoidasi bilan: **-아/어 + 지다**:\n\n- 좋다 → **좋아지다** (yaxshilanmoq)\n- 크다 → **커지다** (kattalashmoq)\n- 춥다 → **추워지다** (sovuqlashmoq)\n- 익숙하다 → **익숙해지다** (ko'nikmoq)\n- 친하다 → **친해지다** (yaqinlashmoq)\n- 다르다 → **달라지다** (boshqacha bo'lmoq)\n\n### Esda tuting\n\n- Natijada **fe'l** bo'ladi: **좋아졌어요**, **좋아질 거예요**, **좋아지고 있어요**.\n- **점점** (borgan sari) bilan ko'p: **점점 따뜻해져요.**\n- Faqat **sifatlar** bilan; fe'llar bilan — **-게 되다** (keyingi grammatika).",
      "explanation_md_en": "**-아/어지다** attaches to an adjective to show a **change of state**: \"**to become …**\", \"**to get …**\".\n\n**날씨가 점점 추워져요.** — *It's getting colder and colder.*\n\n### How to form it\n\nUse the -아요/어요 rule: **-아/어 + 지다**:\n\n- 좋다 → **좋아지다** (to get better)\n- 크다 → **커지다** (to get bigger)\n- 춥다 → **추워지다** (to get colder)\n- 익숙하다 → **익숙해지다** (to get used to)\n- 친하다 → **친해지다** (to become close)\n- 다르다 → **달라지다** (to become different)\n\n### Remember\n\n- The result is a **verb**: **좋아졌어요**, **좋아질 거예요**, **좋아지고 있어요**.\n- Often with **점점** (gradually): **점점 따뜻해져요.**\n- Only with **adjectives**; with verbs use **-게 되다** (next point).",
      "formation": [
        {
          "condition_uz": "ㅏ/ㅗ",
          "condition_en": "ㅏ/ㅗ",
          "rule": "-아지다",
          "example": "좋아지다, 많아지다"
        },
        {
          "condition_uz": "Boshqa",
          "condition_en": "Other vowels",
          "rule": "-어지다",
          "example": "커지다, 추워지다, 길어지다"
        },
        {
          "condition_uz": "하다",
          "condition_en": "하다",
          "rule": "해지다",
          "example": "익숙해지다, 친해지다"
        }
      ],
      "examples": [
